{"material_id": "ntce.gaozhong.dili.2019b.q19.material.recovered", "text": "阅读关于“地球的运动”的图文资料，按要求完成教学设计任务。材料—《普通高中地理课程标准（实验版）》的内容要求：“分析地球运动的地理意义”。材料二某版本教科书中关于“地球的公转”的部分内容。地球的公转地球公转的方向与自转方向一致，也是自西向东，地球公转轨道是近似正圆的椭圆形轨道，太阳位于椭圆的一个焦点上，每年1月初、地球处于近日点，7月初、处于远日点。日地平均距离约为1.5亿千米。地球在公转的过程中还在不停地自转着。地球公转的轨道面称为黄道面，地球自转时，地轴的指向几乎是不变的，因此就存在基本不变的赤道面，黄道面与赤道面之间存在一个交角，称为黄赤交角。目前黄赤交角是23°26'，地轴同公转轨道面斜交的角度为66°34'。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年下半年教师资格证考试《高中地理》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "592edd6047d80d77c8c8d5d375c2fd98bf69b34530c870381f5d7facc4f219a1", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2860, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3173, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年下半年教师资格证考试《高中地理》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 19, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "592edd6047d80d77c8c8d5d375c2fd98bf69b34530c870381f5d7facc4f219a1"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.dili.2019b.q19"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.dili.s1.k02", "ntce.gaozhong.dili.s3.k02", "ntce.gaozhong.dili.s3.k03"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.ability.design", "ntce.gaozhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.411.r001", "ntce.outline.411.r006", "ntce.outline.411.r007", "ntce.outline.411.r011", "ntce.outline.411.r016", "ntce.outline.411.r017", "ntce.outline.411.r018"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.gaozhong.dili.2019b.q19"], "word_count": 313, "level": "gaozhong", "subject": "dili", "kind": "lesson_plan_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年下半年教师资格证考试《高中地理》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年下半年教师资格证考试《高中地理》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "592edd6047d80d77c8c8d5d375c2fd98bf69b34530c870381f5d7facc4f219a1", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2860, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3173